<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bula says Morrissey resigns as director.</title>
<headline>Bula says Morrissey resigns as director.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish exploration group Bula Resources (Holdings) Plc said on Friday that James Morrissey had resigned as a director.</p>
<p>Bula said Morrissey has resigned because a requirement of his appointment as a director of public relations firm Murray Consultants was that he relinquish his various directorships in due course.</p>
<p>Morrissey, who has been on the Bula board since 1994, will continue in his capacity as Bula's public relations consultant, Bula said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
